        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mush Dash</i> is an online party racing game for up to 7 players where adorable mushrooms sprint, jump and explode their way through deadly obstacle courses to avoid becoming dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/a58f49d66a3856fd8960d521a45e4e3b.avif?t=1785482579\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is made up of 3 “waves”. At the start of the game, 3 stages are randomly chosen from 5 waves in the selected theme. Survive the traps, reach the goal and grab as many Mushroom Coins as you can along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/2e66a261f8d39543a10693ad4ff4fd7c.avif?t=1785482579\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing first is great, but it’s not everything. Your final rank is decided by both your position at the finish line <strong>and</strong> the Mushroom Coins you’ve collected, so a clever route or a risky shortcut can flip the results at the last second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/a44544573108ad3f9916e3e2bbae6a8f.avif?t=1785482579\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 7‑player online races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random 3‑wave matches for fresh runs every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, moving platforms and other nasty traps that require pattern reading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom Coins that can steal victory even if you don’t finish first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense rounds that are perfect for voice chat and party play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your mushroom out of the cooking pot and become the champion of <i>Mush Dash</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/e2fc5e5e75cce43f538d3240a8a4b01c.avif?t=1785482579\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mush Dash</i> is an online party racing game for up to 7 players where adorable mushrooms sprint, jump and explode their way through deadly obstacle courses to avoid becoming dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/a58f49d66a3856fd8960d521a45e4e3b.avif?t=1785482579\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is made up of 3 “waves”. At the start of the game, 3 stages are randomly chosen from 5 waves in the selected theme. Survive the traps, reach the goal and grab as many Mushroom Coins as you can along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/2e66a261f8d39543a10693ad4ff4fd7c.avif?t=1785482579\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing first is great, but it’s not everything. Your final rank is decided by both your position at the finish line <strong>and</strong> the Mushroom Coins you’ve collected, so a clever route or a risky shortcut can flip the results at the last second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/a44544573108ad3f9916e3e2bbae6a8f.avif?t=1785482579\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 7‑player online races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random 3‑wave matches for fresh runs every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, moving platforms and other nasty traps that require pattern reading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom Coins that can steal victory even if you don’t finish first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense rounds that are perfect for voice chat and party play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your mushroom out of the cooking pot and become the champion of <i>Mush Dash</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/e2fc5e5e75cce43f538d3240a8a4b01c.avif?t=1785482579\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p>",
